! =============================================================================
! Population III Star Cluster (Primordial, Near-Zero Metallicity)
! =============================================================================
! Physically motivated by: Arca Sedda et al. (2026, arXiv:2603.29657)
!
! Science case:
!   The first star clusters formed from primordial gas at Z ~ 0 in the
!   early universe (z ~ 10-20).  Pop III clusters are predicted to have
!   a top-heavy IMF (dominated by massive stars, 8-300 Msun) because
!   the lack of metals suppresses gas cooling and fragmentation.
!
!   At near-zero metallicity, stellar winds are negligible, so massive
!   stars retain most of their mass until core collapse.  This produces:
!     - Very massive BHs (50-250 Msun) via direct collapse
!     - Pair-instability supernovae (140-260 Msun progenitors) leaving
!       NO remnant — a "mass gap" in the BH mass function
!     - Pulsational pair-instability (100-140 Msun) producing ~40-50 Msun BHs
!   The retained massive BHs dominate the cluster dynamics.
!
! Expected phenomena:
!   - Extremely rapid mass segregation (top-heavy IMF)
!   - Pair-instability SN explosions removing massive stars completely
!   - Formation of a massive BH subsystem within ~5 Myr
!   - BH-BH mergers producing GW sources in the LISA band
!   - Possible IMBH formation via BH-BH mergers
!   - Cluster dissolution as SN mass loss unbinds the system
!
! Setup:  N=50k, King W0=6, Z=1e-8 (near-zero), flat IMF (alpha=1.0)
!         with 8-300 Msun (top-heavy), 1% hard binaries, galactic tidal
!         field at 13.3 kpc.  TCRIT=200 NB-units (~500 Myr physical).
!
! Note:  ALPHAS=1.0 gives a flat (top-heavy) IMF: dn/dm ~ m^{-1}, i.e.
!        equal mass per logarithmic mass bin.  Standard Kroupa is 2.35.
!
! Compute cost:  ~1-2 days on 16-24 cores.
! =============================================================================

&INNBODY6
KSTART=1,TCOMP=1.0E8,TCRTP0=172800,isernb=40,iserreg=40,iserks=0 /

&ININPUT
N=50000,NFIX=1,NCRIT=10,NRAND=55123,NNBOPT=80,NRUN=1,NCOMM=10,
ETAI=0.01,ETAR=0.01,RS0=0.12,DTADJ=1.0,DELTAT=5.0,TCRIT=200.0,QE=1.0E-02,RBAR=1.00,ZMBAR=0.7,
KZ(1:10)= 1 1 1 0 1 0 3 2 3 2
KZ(11:20)=0 1 0 2 2 0 0 0 3 6
KZ(21:30)=1 1 2 0 2 2 3 2 0 2
KZ(31:40)=1 0 2 2 1 0 1 1 2 1
KZ(41:50)=0 0 0 0 0 4 3 0 3 0 ,
DTMIN=2.5E-6,RMIN=8.E-5,ETAU=0.1,ECLOSE=1.0,GMIN=1.0E-06,GMAX=0.01,SMAX=1.0,
Level='C' /

&INSSE /

&INBSE /

&INCOLL /

&INDATA
ALPHAS=1.00,BODY1=300.0,BODYN=8.0,NBIN0=250,NHI0=0,ZMET=1.0E-8,EPOCH0=0,DTPLOT=5.0 /

&INSETUP SEMI=,ECC=,APO=,N2=,SCALE=,ZM1=,ZM2,ZMH,RCUT= /

&INSCALE
Q=0.5,VXROT=0.0,VZROT=0.0,RTIDE=0.0 /

&INXTRNL0
GMG=1.78E11,RG0=13.3,DISK=,A=,B=,VCIRC=,RCIRC=,GMB=,AR=,GAM=,RG=,,,VG=,,,MP=,AP2=,MPDOT=,TDELAY= /

&INBINPOP
SEMI0=0.001,ECC0=-1.0,RATIO=1.0,RANGE=5.0,NSKIP=10,IDORM=0 /

&INHIPOP
SEMI0=,ECC0=,RATIO=,RANGE= /

